# switchboard runtime state and private material. The kit tracks code, prompts,
# skills and templates; everything a day of use produces stays local.

# Shared state, person notes and secrets never go to GitHub
# (install.py seeds people/README.md and people/_template.md from templates/people/)
/.state
/people
# Owner context, per-machine settings and the nightly backup (docs/profiles.md,
# docs/backup-and-restore.md). Never tracked and never in the kit; install and cleanup
# scripts must not delete it. /local also covers a worktree's link to main's folder,
# which /local/ alone would miss because a link is not a directory to git.
/local
/local/
/.firecrawl
/system/archive
/system/logs
/system/plans
.env
.openai-key
.secrets-*
.DS_Store
daemon/*.log
*.swp
*.swo
*~
routines/.bg-tasks/
notes/sensitive/
notes/chrome-tabs/
projects/**/meetings/*1on1*.md
projects/**/meetings/*1-1*.md
projects/**/meetings/*one-on-one*.md
projects/**/meetings/*handoff*.md
projects/**/meetings/*hand-off*.md

# Personal config rendered from the *.example.yaml templates
system/config/priority-channels.yaml
system/config/stakeholders.yaml

# Per-machine harness adapter state (the shared adapters in .claude/, .codex/,
# .cursor/ and adapters/ are tracked)
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/skills/
.codex/auth.json

# Amp worktrees and scratch
.amp/
!.amp/
.amp/*
!.amp/plugins/
.amp/in/

# Generated switchboard runtime state
system/background-task-state.json
system/background-task-attempts.json
system/job-state.json
system/today-plan.json
system/plans/*.json
system/logs/*.log
system/logs/**
system/recall/*.sqlite3
system/state/**
!system/state/README.md
# The to-do list, its backups and its archive stay ignored: the push policy in
# AGENTS.md names them sensitive and dispatch.py auto-push refuses while any is
# tracked. They live only on this machine.

# Obsidian vault: track shared config, ignore per-machine layout and caches
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
.obsidian/workspaces.json
.obsidian/cache/
.obsidian/plugins/
.obsidian/graph.json
.obsidian/hotkeys.json
.trash/

# Structural knowledge graph (build-knowledge-graph.py output, rebuilt locally)
graphify-out/

# Generated Python/cache artifacts
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
**/.skill-data/
workstreams/*/.signals/
workstreams/*/generated/
workstreams/**/.amp/
# A workstream's verbatim asks (new-workstream.py writes them here, never to tracked files)
workstreams/**/private/

# Private workstream (system/config/private-workstreams.txt): real content stays in the folder
# on the main checkout. Only CONTEXT.md and config.yaml are tracked, live or archived.

# Generated digests and transient outputs
outputs/automation-inbox/
outputs/comms-triage/
outputs/.pending-comms.*
outputs/daily-rollup/
outputs/meeting-notes/
outputs/todo-refresh/
outputs/inbox-media/

# Organisation profile state written by system/scripts/apply-profile.py (per machine)
.switchboard-kit/profile.json
.switchboard-kit/profile-backup/

# todo.json is private (AGENTS.md push policy); system/state/** above already ignores it, kept as a backstop
system/state/todo.json
